Z||000000||GREENDANO||12-10-1999||09:57 PM||||Here it is, a picture of my F40.  It's on an 86 SE chassis.  Lots of parts have been ordered for it and more are needed.  I got it from a dude in Ohio.  I thought I had a Fiero fetish.  This guy's got 5 I think, and had just acquired another one the day I drove down to see it.  <BR>  The F40 has a 350 Chevy motor already installed and running with the body installed that needs MUCH finish work!!  Very rough car to say the least but still a fixable car.  Those of you that know my projects that I've done in the past know what i'm capable of, this car will be the best yet creation coming out of my shop.  (that's even compared to the Rolls Royce I restored)<BR>  Here's a picture... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/f40c.jpg"> <P>Dan-O||||reg||1
Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||12-11-1999||01:46 AM||||Dan-O, a few more days and I should have the photos online that you sent me..||||reg||1
